notes:        Generated by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from scratch as their own test data for the effectcraft-aep container tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The same file as the earlier single-case fixture 001-empty.aep. Colour profile payloads removed: every embedded ICC profile (the working-space profile in the settings JSON, and the profile of imported footage) was replaced by a description-only stub made in code (tools/aep/stubicc.rs: 128-byte header, one `desc` tag with the original profile name, no colour data). The stub keeps the working-space name for metadata tests; it is not a colour-transform oracle. Final bytes checked with tools/aep/inspect-embedded.py (raw, base64 and AEPX hex): only stubs remain, no vendor strings, no personal paths or names (docs/aep/2026-11-03-initial-corpus.md).
